{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】西營盤一座大廈有單位起火，消防到場救出一名70多歲男子。</p>\n<p>男子救出後昏迷，需在擔架上用自動心外壓機急救，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院救治。</p>\n<p>起火單位內熏黑，多名居民疏散到街上。現場是薄扶林道恆輝大廈8樓一個單位，消防夜晚近9時接報單位起火，出動一條喉和一隊煙帽隊撲救。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:20:01.519826+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:10:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:45.530934+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:45.530934+00:00","content_hash":"2c9d025626f42a837fc1f5b2acc66eb85055d1aa54525d41a113a2346714bdd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}